## Two weeks at a glance

kpi Total rides | 54,410 | 14 days

kpi Daily average | 3,886 | rides per day
kpi Week 2 | 28,370 | +8.9% vs week 1 | good
kpi Busiest day | 5,340 | Sat 2026-10-17
kpi Quietest day | 2,280 | Thu 2026-10-08, rain | bad

Week 1 carried 26,040 rides and week 2 carried 28,370, up 8.9%. The network has 86 stations and 1,100 bikes.

## Daily rides

chart bar rides y=rides target="3886 daily average" title="Rides per day"

Weekends dominate both weeks. Thursday 2026-10-08 was the outlier low: 31 mm of rain cut rides to 2,280.

## Weekdays and weekends

chart bar split labels unit=" rides" title="Average rides per day"

Weekend days averaged 5,162.5 rides against 3,376 on weekdays, about 53% more.

! Extra rebalancing crews will do the most good on Saturdays and Sundays, when demand runs about 1,800 rides a day above weekdays.
